        "_id": "68652c447b17a1c2120e63a8",
        "title": "How AI Revolutionizes Oracle Cloud Infrastructure for Businesses",
        "description": "Artificial intelligence (AI) is fast changing how companies run in the realm of technology. It has transformed many sectors, and combined with \u003Ca href=\"https://plenum-tech.com/service/oracle\" target=\"_blank\"\u003EOracle Cloud Infrastructure\u003C/a\u003E (OCI), artificial intelligence offers a fresh degree of scalability, automation, and efficiency. We will discuss in this article what artificial intelligence is, how it interacts with Oracle Cloud Infrastructure, and the major advantages companies might get from this explosive mix.",
        "metaDescription": "Discover how AI transforms Oracle Cloud Infrastructure by boosting automation, scalability, security, and decision-making across industries.",
