        "_id": "6878d7fac23b1aa842f57e75",
        "title": "How to Create Custom Dashboards in Dynamics 365",
        "description": "You're already one step closer to getting powerful visual insights and making your team more productive in Dynamics 365 if you want to make custom dashboards. Whether you work in sales, marketing, customer service, or banking, Dynamics 365 screens give you a clear, visual way to keep track of performance, keep an eye on key performance indicators (KPIs), and make choices based on data. In \u003Ca href=\"https://plenum-tech.com/service/microsoft-dynamics\" target=\"_blank\"\u003EDynamics 365\u003C/a\u003E, this article shows you how to make and change dashboards, such as personal and dynamic dashboards and custom tools.",
        "metaDescription": "Learn how to create custom dashboards in Dynamics 365 with this detailed guide. Explore personalized and interactive dashboards, custom controls, and dashboard best practices.",
        "category": "Blog",
        "blogCategory": "plenum",
        "userRef": {
            "_id": "68661ad1a62859854fb1162f",
            "fullname": "Xntric",
            "email": "info@xntric.me"
        },
        "comments": [],
        "like": [],
