        "title": "Everything You Need to Know About Microsoft Dynamics NAV in 2025",
        "description": "Even in 2025, Microsoft Dynamics NAV is still one of the best and most adaptable enterprise resource planning (ERP) systems for small to medium-sized organisations. Dynamics NAV started out as Navision and was later bought by Microsoft. It has since grown into a powerful tool for managing finances, the supply chain, manufacturing, and business information.\r\nMicrosoft Dynamics NAV is still useful for enterprises who need a lot of customisation and on-premise features, even if \u003Ca href=\"https://plenum-tech.com/service/business-central\" target=\"_blank\"\u003EMicrosoft Dynamics 365 Business Central \u003C/a\u003Eis becoming more popular. \r\nThis article will tell you all you need to know in 2025, whether you still use NAV, are thinking about moving to a new system, or are looking for a reputable Microsoft Dynamics NAV partner.",
