                "question": "Q1: Is Dynamics 365 part of Power Apps?",
                "answer": "Dynamics 365 apps are built on the same Power Platform as Power Apps, but they are separate offerings. Power Apps can connect to Dynamics 365 data to create custom interfaces or workflows."
