                        "listDescription": "While some agencies specialize solely in coding, others provide website design and development services under one roof. A full-service agency can handle everything from branding and UI/UX design to hosting, maintenance, and digital marketing. \u003C/br\u003E Popular services offered by leading web development companies in Dubai include:",
