        "title": "Leadership Branding Explained for 2025",
        "description": "In 2025, when businesses are migrating to remote-first cultures, digital transparency, and purpose-driven performance, your personal leadership brand has the ability to separate you from other candidates to the extent that you are able to differentiate yourself from them. This is more than what should ever be included on your CV. An important thing to ask is, what precisely does it imply?",
        "metaDescription": "Discover what a leadership branding is, why it matters in 2025, and explore powerful personal leadership brand examples.",
