            {
                "question": "How do I ensure a successful Microsoft Dynamics 365 CRM implementation?",
                "answer": "Work with an experienced Microsoft Dynamics partner, define clear objectives, prioritize training, and maintain strong project governance."
            },
            {
                "question": "Can over-customization harm my Microsoft Dynamics CRM system?",
                "answer": "Yes. Excessive customizations make updates harder, increase costs, and can negatively impact performance."
            }
