                "question": "Q1: What is the difference between AI-marketing and traditional digital marketing?",
                "answer": "AI-marketing uses machine learning, automation, predictive analysis to make decisions, optimize campaigns in real time, and personalize experience. Traditional digital marketing relies more on manual inputs, intuition, and past experience. AI can scale & adapt faster than purely manual approaches."
