                "answer": "The most useful app depends on your business model. For retail, an \u003Ca href=\"https://sell.amazon.com/learn/what-is-ecommerce\" target=\"_blank\"\u003Ee-commerce\u003C/a\u003E app is ideal, while service-based businesses benefit from booking or customer service apps."
