                        "listDescription": "These examples show that ERP automation is not limited to one domain, it can span finance, operations, \u003Ca href=\"https://www.coursera.org/articles/what-is-hr\" target=\"_blank\"\u003EHR\u003C/a\u003E, supply chain, and projects.",
