        "_id": "68ef576aac08e08e2e57bd37",
        "title": "ERP’s New Era How AI Agents Are Driving Transformation",
        "description": "We are witnessing a profound shift in \u003Ca href=\"https://plenum-tech.com/service/ERP-consulting\" target=\"_blank\"\u003EEnterprise Resource Planning (ERP)\u003C/a\u003E, one that is ushering in ERP’s New Era How AI Agents Are Driving Transformation across core business functions. \r\nThis transformation moves beyond traditional, supportive AI to fully autonomous AI agents that act as \"digital collaborators,\" capable of taking ownership of specific, complex workflows. The momentum is clear: over 80% of business leaders expect these AI agents to become a significant part of their strategic operations. \r\nLeaders in the space, like \u003Ca href=\"https://plenum-tech.com/service/ERP-consulting\" target=\"_blank\"\u003EMicrosoft Dynamics 365\u003C/a\u003E, are at the forefront of this change, where AI is actively reshaping how \u003Ca href=\"https://plenum-tech.com/service/finance-operations\" target=\"_blank\"\u003Efinance, supply chain, and operations\u003C/a\u003E teams perform their daily tasks, resulting in processes that are smarter, more cost-effective, and highly scalable.\r\n",
        "metaDescription": "Explore ERP’s New Era: How AI Agents Are Driving Transformation in finance, supply chain, and operations, leveraging solutions like Microsoft Dynamics 365.",
        "category": "Blog",
        "blogCategory": "plenum",
        "userRef": {
            "_id": "68661ad1a62859854fb1162f",
            "fullname": "Xntric",
            "email": "info@xntric.me"
        },
        "comments": [],
        "like": [],
